The [[Amulet of Fortune]] is a rare item normally obtained by buying the [[Unidentified Amulet]] from the shop. Most importantly, it raises the likelihood of chance-based effects in the nearby items. This works great with a wide-variety of items, including some [[weapon]]s and all [[shield]]s.
